docs {
  # Admin List Sliders

  Returns all sliders, active and inactive, for the admin dashboard.

  ## Endpoint

  `GET /api/v1/admin/sliders`

  Requires admin JWT.

  ## Expected Response

  ```json
  {
    "sliders": [
      {
        "id": "slider_id",
        "title": "Promo banner",
        "imageUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/.../banner.webp",
        "linkUrl": "/services/data",
        "isActive": true,
        "sortOrder": 1,
        "createdAt": "2026-09-10T12:00:00.000Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-10T12:00:00.000Z"
      }
    ],
    "count": 1
  }
  ```
}
